OL,3,AManhunt after shooting at Swiss rave
OL,4,Akills woman, 22, and injures five
OL,5,
OL,6,FA manhunt is under way after a
OL,7,F22-year-old woman was killed and five
OL,8,Fothers injured in a shooting at a rave
OL,9,Fin Switzerland.
OL,11,FItalian national Maria Spinelli died at
OL,12,Fthe scene in Aarau on Sunday morning,
OL,13,Fpolice said. Four men and a woman, aged
OL,14,Fbetween 24 and 27, were in hospital
OL,15,Fwith injuries "ranging from minor to
OL,16,Fsevere".
OL,18,FItaly's prime minister Giorgia Meloni
OL,19,Fsaid she was confident Swiss
OL,20,Fauthorities would "shed full light on
OL,21,Fwhat happened and find anyone
OL,22,Fresponsible".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
